and in my last video I revealed some fun facts

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:19.660
you probably didn't know about The Boss Baby,
but now, in this video, I want to let you

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:24.150
in on some cool easter eggs, hidden details,
and movie references in the film.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:28.430
Before I get started, I'm giving away a second
